<view class="page">
  <view class="dark-header"><view class="welcome-row"><view class="avatar">{{profile.name ? profile.name[0] : '砼'}}</view><view><view class="welcome">欢迎回来，{{profile.name || '砼友'}}</view><view class="verified">✓ {{identity.name}} · 已认证</view></view></view><view class="ticker">⚡ C30 今日指导价 ¥388/方 ↑3　 P·O42.5 水泥 ¥365/吨　 机制砂 ¥98/吨 ↑2</view></view>
  <view class="section intro-wrap"><text class="subtle">报价、周边站点和询价需求都集中在这里处理。</text></view>
  <view class="section"><view class="section-title">快捷操作</view><view class="action-row"><button class="primary-action" bindtap="goQuotes">立即询价　›</button><button class="dark-action" bindtap="locate">{{locating ? '定位中…' : '⌖ 重新定位'}}</button></view></view>
  <view class="section"><view class="title-row"><view class="section-title">附近搅拌站</view><text class="subtle">共 {{stations.length}} 座</text></view><view class="map-card"><map id="station-map" class="map" latitude="{{latitude}}" longitude="{{longitude}}" scale="13" markers="{{markers}}" show-location="true"/><view class="map-address">⌖ {{profile.address || '郑州市经开区'}}</view></view>
    <view class="card station-list"><view wx:for="{{stations}}" wx:key="id" class="station-row"><view class="distance">{{item.distance}} 公里</view><view class="station-copy"><text>{{item.name}}</text><view><text>C30 参考 ¥{{item.c30}}/方 · </text><text class="{{item.status === '产能充足' ? 'status-good' : 'status-warn'}}">{{item.status}}</text></view></view><button class="nav-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="navigate">导航</button></view></view>
  </view>
</view>
